Why Is Demand Increasing
AI and Emotion Recognition: Advances in deep learning, computer vision, speech analysis, and physiological-signal processing are improving the accuracy of emotion recognition.
Personalized Experiences: Businesses are increasingly using real-time emotional insights to personalize customer interactions, services, content, and digital experiences.
Cross-Industry Adoption: Healthcare, automotive, education, retail, entertainment, and customer service are expanding their use of multimodal systems for emotion-aware applications.

Multimodal Affective Computing Watch: Contactless Emotion Intelligence
Contactless solutions are gaining importance as organizations seek scalable and non-invasive methods for interpreting emotional states. Combining facial expressions, speech, text, gestures, and physiological signals enables systems to build a more comprehensive understanding of human behavior, creating opportunities across customer experience, healthcare monitoring, driver safety, and adaptive learning.

